  "description": "DAJWEU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C42 H54 B4 N28 O15 Tb4. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 4 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 4 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 4 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.650-3.681 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.17-110.57°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C42H54B4N28O15Tb4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
